    {
      "id": "claim_0ea5b37e7ffb412cb67626db07d4abca",
      "statement": "The backend enables the global_fetch_strictly_public compatibility flag so production fetch() is strictly internet-facing (an SSRF guard, notably for the webFetch agent tool), alongside allow_irrevocable_stub_storage and nodejs_compat for persistent stubs, provider SDKs, and Puppeteer PDF export.",
      "evidence": [
