    {
      "id": "claim_2c162a6bed75469d9051cbd2563e4927",
      "statement": "The backend serves its RPC API only at the /api path: HTTP POST gets a Cap'n Web batch response (cross-origin allowed because the API uses in-band authorization), and a WebSocket upgrade opens a persistent session the server can abort via an AbortSignal-backed close.",
