    {
      "id": "claim_525badc1a58e44d7a4500a2d9906a860",
      "statement": "A Gadget runs as two isolated sandboxes: server.js executes in a Dynamic Worker with internet access disabled, reaching outside only through injected bindings; client.js runs in a sandboxed iframe that talks to the server exclusively through a Cap'n Web RPC session established over postMessage.",
