    {
      "id": "claim_df2cfdbf05194a5e901a955235a1a18b",
      "statement": "The Overseer loads a gadget's running facet on demand through the LOADER binding with a cache key of workspace id + code version + gadget id, names facets per gadget, and defensively aborts/reloads a facet when it cannot confirm the running code state.",
